WEBVTT

1
00:00:25,870 --> 00:00:27,470
I'm not afraid

2
00:00:27,470 --> 00:00:29,070
I just thought there was an earthquake

3
00:00:29,070 --> 00:00:30,470
It's safer to hide there

4
00:00:30,470 --> 00:00:34,560
We live so high

5
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:35,960
What if there was an earthquake?

6
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:37,960
No matter where you hide, I'll crush you.
